{"final":{"answer":"The net change in Entergy Mississippi, Inc.'s net revenue during 2003 was an increase of $46.4 million.","value":46.4,"unit":"USD_million","sources":["source:t1c1n0","source:t4c1n0","source:t2c1n0","source:t3c1n0"],"result_id":"tool:1","message":"2003 net revenue ($426.6 million) minus 2002 net revenue ($380.2 million) = $46.4 million increase. This agrees with the component movements: base rates +$48.3 million and other -$1.9 million, i.e. 380.2 + 48.3 - 1.9 = 426.6, confirming the $46.4 million net change."}}